                        rdfs:comment "Catalogue of available types of products and materials that are used to build or install, maintain or operate an Asset. Each catalogue item is for a specific product (AssetModel) available from a specific supplier."@en;
                        rdfs:isDefinedBy <https://cimbology.com/ontology/iec61968.ttl>;
