cim:CustomerBillingInfo a owl:Class;
                        rdfs:comment "The creation of the monthly customer billing statements is the method employed to notify Customers of charges, adjustments and credits applied to their account for Services and Products. The actuall billing occurs through an ErpInvoice. The CustomerBillingInfo includes information from the payment, collection, meter reading, installed meter, service, site, customer, customer account, customer agreement, services and pricing subject areas. Each component price shows up as a separate line item on the ErpInvoice. The Customer Billing Statement may include collection and account messages, marketing/civic event messages and bill inserts. One Customer Billing Statement is produced for all Agreements under a CustomerAccount per billing cycle date defined in 'CustomerAccount. billingCycle'. The history of CustomerBillingInfo, Invoices and Payments is to be maintained in associated ActivityRecords."@en;
                        rdfs:isDefinedBy <https://cimbology.com/ontology/iec61968.ttl>;
                        rdfs:label "CustomerBillingInfo"@en;
                        rdfs:subClassOf cim:Document;
                        cimdoc:cimPackage "IEC61968.InfIEC61968.InfCustomers";
                        cimdoc:packageTier "Informative".
cim:CustomerBillingInfo.CustomerAccount a owl:ObjectProperty;
                                        rdfs:comment "The customer account"@en;
                                        rdfs:domain cim:CustomerBillingInfo;
                                        rdfs:isDefinedBy <https://cimbology.com/ontology/iec61968.ttl>;
                                        rdfs:label "CustomerAccount"@en;
                                        rdfs:range cim:CustomerAccount.
cim:CustomerBillingInfo.ErpInvoiceLineItems a owl:ObjectProperty;
                                            rdfs:comment "The erp invoice line items"@en;
                                            rdfs:domain cim:CustomerBillingInfo;
                                            rdfs:isDefinedBy <https://cimbology.com/ontology/iec61968.ttl>;
                                            rdfs:label "ErpInvoiceLineItems"@en;
                                            rdfs:range cim:ErpInvoiceLineItem.
cim:CustomerBillingInfo.billingDate a owl:DatatypeProperty;
                                    rdfs:comment "Business date designated for the billing run which produced this CustomerBillingInfo."@en;
                                    rdfs:domain cim:CustomerBillingInfo;
                                    rdfs:isDefinedBy <https://cimbology.com/ontology/iec61968.ttl>;
                                    rdfs:label "billingDate"@en;
                                    rdfs:range xsd:date.
cim:CustomerBillingInfo.dueDate a owl:DatatypeProperty;
                                rdfs:comment "Calculated date upon which a customer billing amount is due, used in the invoicing process to determine when a Customer's Payment is delinquent. It takes into consideration the regulatory criteria and the Customer's requested due date. In the absence of a Customer requested due date, the due date is typically calculated from the regulated number of days and the 'billingDate'."@en;
                                rdfs:domain cim:CustomerBillingInfo;
                                rdfs:isDefinedBy <https://cimbology.com/ontology/iec61968.ttl>;
                                rdfs:label "dueDate"@en;
                                rdfs:range xsd:date.
cim:CustomerBillingInfo.kind a owl:ObjectProperty;
                             rdfs:comment "Kind of bill customer receives."@en;
                             rdfs:domain cim:CustomerBillingInfo;
                             rdfs:isDefinedBy <https://cimbology.com/ontology/iec61968.ttl>;
                             rdfs:label "kind"@en;
                             rdfs:range cim:CustomerBillingKind.
cim:CustomerBillingInfo.lastPaymentAmt a owl:DatatypeProperty;
                                       rdfs:comment "Amount of the last payment received from the customer. It is retained in the Customer Billing system, although the details of each payment are tracked in the ERP system."@en;
                                       rdfs:domain cim:CustomerBillingInfo;
                                       rdfs:isDefinedBy <https://cimbology.com/ontology/iec61968.ttl>;
                                       rdfs:label "lastPaymentAmt"@en;
                                       rdfs:range cim:Money.
cim:CustomerBillingInfo.lastPaymentDate a owl:DatatypeProperty;
                                        rdfs:comment "Date of the last payment received from the customer. It is retained in the Customer Billing system, although the details of each payment are tracked in the ERP system."@en;
                                        rdfs:domain cim:CustomerBillingInfo;
                                        rdfs:isDefinedBy <https://cimbology.com/ontology/iec61968.ttl>;
                                        rdfs:label "lastPaymentDate"@en;
                                        rdfs:range xsd:date.
cim:CustomerBillingInfo.outBalance a owl:DatatypeProperty;
                                   rdfs:comment "Outstanding balance on the CustomerAccount as of the statement date."@en;
                                   rdfs:domain cim:CustomerBillingInfo;
                                   rdfs:isDefinedBy <https://cimbology.com/ontology/iec61968.ttl>;
                                   rdfs:label "outBalance"@en;
                                   rdfs:range cim:Money.
cim:CustomerBillingInfo.pymtPlanAmt a owl:DatatypeProperty;
                                    rdfs:comment "Monthly amortized amount due during each billing cycle for the CustomerAccount balance for which the Payment Plan is set-up."@en;
                                    rdfs:domain cim:CustomerBillingInfo;
                                    rdfs:isDefinedBy <https://cimbology.com/ontology/iec61968.ttl>;
                                    rdfs:label "pymtPlanAmt"@en;
                                    rdfs:range cim:Money.
cim:CustomerBillingInfo.pymtPlanType a owl:DatatypeProperty;
                                     rdfs:comment "Type of payment plan."@en;
                                     rdfs:domain cim:CustomerBillingInfo;
                                     rdfs:isDefinedBy <https://cimbology.com/ontology/iec61968.ttl>;
                                     rdfs:label "pymtPlanType"@en;
                                     rdfs:range xsd:string.
cim:CustomerBillingKind a owl:Class;
                        rdfs:comment "Kind of customer billing."@en;
