cim:TransformerApplicationKind a owl:Class;
                               rdfs:comment "Classifications of network roles in which transformers can be deployed. The classifications are intended to reflect both criticality of transformer in network operations and typical usage experienced by transformer. Note: This enumeration provides essential information to asset health analytics. The existing list is a starting point and is anticipated to be fleshed out further as requirements are better understood (PAB 2016/01/09)."@en;
